Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 07:18:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 12/19] HIP GCN: rocBLAS solution autotune for prompt GEMMs
 (GGML_HIP_GEMM_TUNE_FILE)

rocBLAS's default for the FFN down projection on gfx900 is a 32x32-tile kernel at 5.3-5.4 TFLOPS;
another listed solution runs it at 14.7-17.2. The first call of a (cc, m, n bucket, k) times the default
and every listed solution and keeps the fastest; choices are appended to GGML_HIP_GEMM_TUNE_FILE with the
rocBLAS version and read back on load. MI25, 20k reads: Gemma 4 12B 313 -> 416 t/s, Qwen3.5 9B 505 ->
666; writing unchanged. GGML_HIP_GEMM_TUNE=0 turns it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TS8XWm5bp2cWmYvbQ5tTBK
